category: Net
requires: cygwin libcairo2 libglib2.0_0 libguac25 libpango1.0_0
sdesc: "Server-side, native components that form the Guacamole proxy (runtime /terminal)"
ldesc: "The guacamole-server package is a set of software which forms the basis of the
Guacamole stack. It consists of guacd, libguac, and several protocol support
libraries."
external-source: guacamole-server

